# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Paid material. Netlify's own servers decide before any file is sent.
# A reader who is not entitled never receives the file at all.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# The full curriculum teaching. Same lock as the course: Netlify's own
# servers send these files only to a signed-in account holding
# curriculum, member or admin. Everyone else gets the locked page.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Psychiatry for Residents. Old Age, Core, Formulation, Ward realities and
# Specific skills are free. The other specialties' challenges are sent only
# to a subscriber (res-sub) or an audio-course member (res-audio); the paid
# audio lessons only to res-audio.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
/paid/res/*    /paid/res/:splat    200!   Role=res-sub,res-audio,admin
/paid/res/*    /locked.html?w=res-sub   302!
/rcourse/p/*   /rcourse/p/:splat   200!   Role=res-audio,admin
/rcourse/p/*   /locked.html?w=res-audio&r=/rcourse/p/:splat  302!

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# The Paper A course.
#
# These two lines are read by Netlify's own servers, before any file is
# sent. The first says that a chapter is served only to a signed in
# account whose roles include the course. The second catches everybody
# else and sends them to the locked page. A reader who is not entitled
# to a chapter never receives it at all, so there is nothing in the
# browser to get around.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
/course/*   /course/:splat   200!   Role=paper-a,admin
/course/*   /locked.html?w=paper-a     302!

/course-b/*   /course-b/:splat   200!   Role=paper-b,admin
/course-b/*   /locked.html?w=paper-b       302!

